Evaluation data (not used for training)
---------------------------------------

The model was chosen on HeOCR's open synthetic document sets (CC0 code; text
from Reshumot, PD-IL) and on development line sets whose references come
from Hebrew Wikisource (CC BY-SA 4.0), Project Ben-Yehuda (public domain),
Sefaria (public domain) and Reshumot (PD-IL). They were never trained on.
The model contains no evaluation text. The model card links to the
registered benchmark for real held-out modern print.

